      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>An enormous tawny great cat with six legs and no ears. Barbed quills run along its back and down a long, flexible tail. Its eyes are wide and hypnotic, with spiralling pupils.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.u3owPBswTYDEuJAk]{13. The Quilled Hunter}.</strong> Stalks the PCs through the canyon on the Hunt Clock; at 6 it ambushes with Frumious Charge. Withdraws into the thickets below 100 HP to heal; fights to the death in its den.</p>"
    },
